              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Recommendations",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#7031C5"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1. Win back US customers.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " Find out which US customers stopped buying after 2008 and target them with retention and win-back offers.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2. Rethink US discounts.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " The average US discount fell from $200 to $171 while volume stayed low. Test bigger discounts on touring and road bikes and track the effect on margin.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3. Keep investing in touring, road and off-road bikes.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " They make up almost all revenue, so stock and marketing should follow them.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "4. Review the Fixed Gear Bike Plus.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " It sold 72 units in five years. Relaunch it with a clear plan or drop it.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "5. Plan around the season.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " Build stock before April and run promotions from November to February, where the First Aid Kit and accessories can carry sales.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
